      "id": "03-fats",
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "fats",
      "text": "100 grams of fat. Cholesterol is 0 milligrams, so one animal-fat downside is absent. Saturated fat is 13.8 grams, controlled for a pure oil, and polyunsaturated fat is 10.5 grams with 760 milligrams of omega 3 adding backup. For oils and fats, the whole ranking mostly comes down to fat quality.",
